{%- comment -%} Jointwell storefront. KEEP UNDER ~95KB — Shopify's sync sile {%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Product lookup, most specific first. Previous handles are kept as
    fallbacks so a rename can never strand the buy box again: the page has
    been through four brand names and each rename changed the handle.
  endcomment
  assign lp_product = section.settings.product
  if lp_product == blank or lp_product.id == blank
    assign lp_product = all_products['jointwell-heated-joint-massager']
  endif
  if lp_product == blank or lp_product.id == blank
    assign lp_product = all_products['thermora-heated-joint-massager']
  endif
  if lp_product == blank or lp_product.id == blank
    assign lp_product = all_products['warmden-heated-knee-massager']
  endif

  comment
    Packs are now REAL VARIANTS with their own baked-in prices — no discount
    codes doing the work. Single / Pair / Family are matched by the position
    of the "Pack" option so renaming a variant can't silently break the page.
  endcomment
  assign v_single = lp_product.variants[0]
  assign v_pair = lp_product.variants[1]

  comment
    CJ only stocks 1pc and 2pc variants, so every Shopify variant has to map
    1:1 onto one of those. The 4-wrap tile is therefore TWO of the Pair
    variant (line quantity 2), which CJ fulfils as 2 x 2pc. There is no
    separate Family variant to mis-map or leave unfulfilled.
  endcomment
  assign wired = false
  if v_single and v_single.id and v_single.price > 0 and v_pair and v_pair.id
    assign wired = true
  endif

  comment
    Summer Sale is a Shopify AUTOMATIC discount (no code, applies to every
    pack including the single). The page mirrors the same percentage so the
    displayed price always equals what checkout charges. If the sale is
    switched off in admin, untick it here too.
  endcomment
  assign sale_end = section.settings.sale_end | default: '2026-09-01T23:59:59+01:00'
  assign now_s = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign end_s = sale_end | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign sale_pct = section.settings.sale_percent | default: 20
  assign sale_on = false
  if section.settings.sale_enabled and now_s < end_s and sale_pct > 0
    assign sale_on = true
  endif
  assign keep = 100 | minus: sale_pct

  assign single_list = v_single.price
  assign pair_list = v_pair.price
  assign fam_list = v_pair.price | times: 2
  if sale_on
    comment
      Shopify computes the DISCOUNT and subtracts it; computing the remainder
      instead (price x 80 / 100) truncates the other half of the sum and lands
      a penny low on every tile. Mirror the checkout, don't approximate it.
    endcomment
    assign unit_off = single_list | times: sale_pct | divided_by: 100
    assign unit_cents = single_list | minus: unit_off
    assign pair_off = pair_list | times: sale_pct | divided_by: 100
    assign pair_cents = pair_list | minus: pair_off
    assign fam_off = fam_list | times: sale_pct | divided_by: 100
    assign fam_cents = fam_list | minus: fam_off
  else
    assign unit_cents = single_list
    assign pair_cents = pair_list
    assign fam_cents = fam_list
  endif

  comment
    The 4-wrap tile is the Pair variant ordered twice, so its price would be
    exactly 2x the pair. To make it genuinely cheaper per wrap, a SECOND
    discount does the rest: an ORDER-class automatic discount in admin
    ("4-wrap bundle") takes a fixed amount off once the subtotal passes the
    threshold, which only the 4-wrap tile reaches. Order-class and
    product-class discounts stack, so this is deterministic rather than two
    product discounts competing. The number below MUST match that discount.

    Gated on sale_on because the admin bundle discount carries the SAME end
    date as the Summer Sale (both 2026-09-01T22:59:59Z). Subtracting it
    unconditionally advertised a 4-wrap price £20 below what checkout would
    actually charge from the moment the discount lapsed.

    If you ever give the bundle discount a different end date from the sale,
    split this back out into its own date check rather than reusing sale_on.
  endcomment
  assign bundle_off = 0
  if sale_on
    assign bundle_off = section.settings.bundle_discount | default: 2000
  endif
  assign fam_cents = fam_cents | minus: bundle_off

  comment
    The struck-through figure is each pack's OWN undiscounted price, so it
    matches the variant in admin. It used to be a multiple of the discounted
    single (2x / 4x), which produced a "was" price no pack had ever sold at.
  endcomment
  assign pair_ref = pair_list
  assign fam_ref = fam_list
  assign pair_save = pair_ref | minus: pair_cents
  assign fam_save = fam_ref | minus: fam_cents
  comment
    TEMPERATURE — READ BEFORE CHANGING.

    Every temperature on this page renders from these three values, so the
    figure can be corrected in one place instead of eleven.

    This matters because the top figure has never been measured on a physical
    unit. It comes from the supplier pack that arrived with the current device.
    The supplier pack for the PREVIOUS device claimed 45-60C on its spec sheet
    while its own graphic said 50C max, and a contradictory 48~58C image was
    excluded from this pack for the same reason. The project's own standing
    rule, written after that episode, is: claim only what has been confirmed on
    a physical unit.

    Two things ride on this number. It is the answer to the whole cordless-vs-
    corded objection, so if it is wrong the mechanism argument goes with it.
    And the safety copy leans on it, because heat at this level held against
    bare skin for a full session is a burn risk, not a marketing detail.

    Measure it with an IR thermometer or a thermocouple, then set the real
    figure here. Filming that same test against a wheat bag also produces the
    strongest ad creative this offer has.
  endcomment
  assign t_min = section.settings.temp_min | default: 45
  assign t_max = section.settings.temp_max | default: 65
  assign t_steps = section.settings.temp_steps | default: '45, 50, 55, 60 and 65'

  assign pair_each = pair_cents | divided_by: 2
  assign fam_each = fam_cents | divided_by: 4

  comment
    "Best value" is a comparative claim, so it only renders when it is true.
    The 4-wrap tile is two Pair units, and its extra saving comes entirely from
    the order-class bundle discount. The moment that discount lapses the family
    pack costs exactly the same per wrap as the pair, and the badge would be
    claiming a better deal that does not exist. Gate it on the arithmetic
    rather than on a date, so it stays correct whatever happens to the
    discounts.
  endcomment
  assign fam_beats_pair = false
  if fam_each < pair_each
    assign fam_beats_pair = true
  endif

  assign unit_disp = unit_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_disp = pair_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_disp = fam_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_each_disp = pair_each | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_each_disp = fam_each | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_save_disp = pair_save | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_save_disp = fam_save | money_without_trailing_zeros
  comment
    Saving measured against buying that many singles, which is the comparison
    a shopper is actually making. Uses the discounted single so it stays
    honest while a sale is running.
  endcomment
  assign pair_vs_singles = unit_cents | times: 2 | minus: pair_cents
  assign fam_vs_singles = unit_cents | times: 4 | minus: fam_cents
  assign pair_vs_disp = pair_vs_singles | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_vs_disp = fam_vs_singles | money_without_trailing_zeros
  comment
    Per-wrap price is the bundle's real argument: the pair is a 28% drop per
    wrap against a single, which the sale-saving figure alone never shows.
  endcomment
  assign pair_per_disp = pair_cents | divided_by: 2 | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_per_disp = fam_cents | divided_by: 4 | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign single_list_disp = single_list | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_list_disp = pair_list | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_list_disp = fam_list | money_without_trailing_zeros

  comment
    Stock bar. Shows the label from settings. If inventory tracking is switched
    on in Shopify and stock falls to the threshold, the JS upgrades it to the
    real count. It never prints a number that did not come from Shopify.
  endcomment
  assign stock_on = section.settings.show_stock

  comment
    protection_product used to be a settings picker of its own, but two
    "type": "product" settings in one schema is invalid Shopify syntax
    ("setting product type can only be inserted once in the settings") and is
    what silently broke every GitHub sync of this file from 672546b onward.
    The handle is stable, so this needed no picker anyway.
  endcomment
  assign plan_product = all_products['priority-handling-order-goes-first']
  assign plan_variant = plan_product.first_available_variant
  assign plan_on = false
  if section.settings.show_protection and plan_variant and plan_variant.available and plan_variant.price > 0
    assign plan_on = true
    assign plan_price_disp = plan_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  endif
-%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#141311;
    --ink-soft:#5d5852;
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --paper-warm:#faf6f1;
    --line:#e6e0d8;
    --ember:#c8500f;
    --ember-hi:#e0631b;
    --ember-tint:#fdeee3;
    --radius-btn:10px;
    --radius-card:14px;
    --maxw:1080px;
    --shadow-soft:0 1px 2px rgba(20,19,17,.05),0 8px 24px rgba(20,19,17,.05);
    --font-display:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;
    --font-body:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  #jw-page, #jw-page *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto}
    #jw-page *,#jw-page *::before,#jw-page *::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  }
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper)}

  /* ---- motion ----------------------------------------------------------
     The reduced-motion block above force-disables every transition, so
     nothing below needs its own guard. Reveal styles are gated on .js-anim,
     which JS adds only when it can observe: without JS the page renders
     fully visible rather than stranding content at opacity 0. */
  #jw-page [id]{scroll-margin-top:82px}   /* sticky header clearance on anchor jumps */

  #jw-page.js-anim [data-rv]{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);
    transition:opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1),transform .7s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}
  #jw-page.js-anim [data-rv].is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}

  /* no will-change here: it promotes the header to its own layer, and with
     backdrop-filter:blur that causes repaint artifacts during scroll.
     Transform animation is composited regardless. */
  #jw-page header.jw-head{transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1),box-shadow .3s ease}
  #jw-page header.jw-head.is-stuck{box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(20,19,17,.09)}
  /* retract only where vertical space is scarce; desktop keeps it pinned */
  @media(max-width:879px){
    #jw-page header.jw-head.is-hidden{transform:translateY(-100%)}
  }

  /* zoom inside the thumb's own overflow:hidden rather than translating the
     tile, which would push the scroll strip's vertical axis */
  #jw-page .thumb img{transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}
  #jw-page .g-arrow{transition:background .18s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}
  @media(hover:hover){
    #jw-page .thumb:hover img{transform:scale(1.07)}
    #jw-page .g-arrow:hover{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(1.08)}
  }
  #jw-page .cta:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.994)}
  #jw-page .tile:active{transform:translateY(0)}

  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav{overflow:hidden;max-height:0;opacity:0;
    transition:max-height .34s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1),opacity .22s ease}
  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav.is-open{max-height:60vh;opacity:1}
  #jw-page{font-family:var(--font-body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.55;font-size:16px}
  /* height:auto is load-bearing: HTML width/height attrs otherwise distort
     any image given width:100% in CSS (the v1 stretch bug). */
  #jw-page img,#jw-page svg,#jw-page video{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  #jw-page a{color:inherit}
  #jw-page h1,#jw-page h2,#jw-page h3{font-family:var(--font-display);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
  #jw-page h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4.5vw,38px);text-align:center;font-weight:800}
  #jw-page h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px}
  #jw-page section{padding:56px 0}
  #jw-page section#buy{padding-top:14px}
  /* 56px top and bottom meet between every section, so a phone gets a
     112px void between blocks that are only a few lines tall */
  @media(max-width:879px){
    #jw-page section{padding:26px 0}
    #jw-page section#buy{padding-bottom:0}
    /* the icon row already ends on a rule, so a second separator plus
       three stacked paddings is what made the hole under it */
    #jw-page .icon-row{padding:18px 0 0;border-bottom:0}
  }
  #jw-page .center{text-align:center}
  #jw-page .lede{max-width:640px;margin:14px auto 0;text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px}

  /* reviews run wider than the rest of the page and the grid fits to however
     many cards exist, so three cards fill the row and sit centred rather than
     leaving an empty fourth column */
  #jw-page #reviews .wrap{max-width:1240px}
  #jw-page .ugcgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:24px;align-items:start;justify-content:center}
  @media(max-width:1000px){#jw-page .ugcgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}}
  @media(max-width:560px){#jw-page .ugcgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto}}
  /* photo runs full bleed to the card edge and carries the card; padding
     lives on the body below it */
  #jw-page .ugcard{margin:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);padding:0;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  #jw-page .ugc-photo{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  #jw-page .ugc-body{padding:18px 20px 22px}
  #jw-page .ugc-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #jw-page .ugc-stars{color:var(--ember);font-size:17px;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1}
  #jw-page .ugc-stars .off{color:#e2dbd2}
  #jw-page .ugc-meta strong{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .ugc-tick{display:inline-flex;width:17px;height:17px;flex:none}
  #jw-page .ugc-tick svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:#1f9d55}
  /* base.css styles blockquote with a left rule, padding and italics */
  #jw-page .ugcard blockquote{margin:12px 0 0;border:0;padding:0;font-style:normal;color:inherit}
  #jw-page .ugcard blockquote p{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .ugcard.is-empty{border:1px dashed var(--line);background:#faf7f3;box-shadow:none}
  #jw-page .ugcard.is-empty .ugc-stars .off{color:#ddd5cb}
  #jw-page .sk{display:block;height:9px;border-radius:5px;background:#e7e0d7;margin-bottom:8px}
  #jw-page .sk.short{width:55%}
  #jw-page .sk.photo{aspect-ratio:3/4;height:auto;border-radius:0;margin:0}
  #jw-page .sk.name{width:40%;height:10px;margin:0}
  #jw-page .sk-lines{margin-top:10px}
  #jw-page .ugc-note{margin-top:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page .usegrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
  @media(max-width:900px){#jw-page .usegrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .usegrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:340px;margin:0 auto}}
  #jw-page .usecard{margin:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);
    overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .usecard img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover}
  #jw-page .experts-shell{position:relative}
  /* one scrolling row, not a wrapping grid: five cards never divide evenly
     into three columns and left two stranded on a short second row */
  #jw-page .experts{display:flex;gap:20px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;padding:4px 2px;max-width:100%}
  #jw-page .experts::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  #jw-page .experts-shell .g-arrow{transition:background .18s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .experts-shell .g-arrow{display:none}}
  #jw-page .expert{flex:0 0 320px;scroll-snap-align:start;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);padding:24px 20px;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center}
  /* push attribution to the bottom so captions line up across cards */
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .expert{flex-basis:82%}}
  #jw-page .expert blockquote{margin:16px 0 0;border:0;padding:0;flex:1 0 auto}
  #jw-page .expert img{width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex:none;
    border:2px solid var(--ember-tint)}
  #jw-page .expert blockquote p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .expert blockquote p + p{margin-top:10px}
  #jw-page .expert figcaption{margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);width:100%}
  #jw-page .expert figcaption strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .expert figcaption span{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.4}
  /* organisation cards show the mark itself, no frame. Portrait cards get a
     round crop; a logo boxed the same way reads as a broken image slot. */
  /* max-height is the binding constraint for square-canvas logo files, where
     a wide wordmark sits in a narrow band with transparent padding around it */
  #jw-page .expert-logo{height:128px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
  #jw-page .expert-logo img{max-height:120px;max-width:240px;width:auto;height:auto;
    object-fit:contain;border:0;border-radius:0;display:block}
  #jw-page .expert-logo.is-placeholder{width:150px;height:74px;border:1px dashed var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;background:#faf7f3;overflow:hidden}
  #jw-page .expert-logo span{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b4aca2}

  /* ============ announcement strip ============ */
  /* Reads as a note from a shop, not an alarm: pale ground, charcoal body
     text at body weight, one bold phrase, no box, no clock, no icon. */
  #jw-page .announce{background:#FDF1EA;color:#3a3631;text-align:center;font-size:15px;
    padding:11px 16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;border-bottom:1px solid #f2ddcd}
  #jw-page .announce b{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .announce{font-size:13.5px;padding:9px 12px}}

  /* ============ header ============ */
  #jw-page header.jw-head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #jw-page .header-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:66px;gap:24px}
  #jw-page .header-in nav.jw-nav{margin-left:auto}
  #jw-page .logo{display:block;text-decoration:none}
  #jw-page .logo img{height:22px;width:auto}
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav a{padding:11px 2px}
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav a:hover,#jw-page nav.jw-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .cart{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-btn);padding:8px 13px;text-decoration:none}
  /* Track my order sits as a bordered button, not a plain link. Returning
     customers arrive on the homepage looking for their parcel, and this
     audience does not scan a row of same-weight nav text for it. */
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav a.jw-track{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;
    color:var(--ember);border:1px solid var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);
    border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;
    margin-left:6px;line-height:1}
  /* hover states latch on touch: the button would sit stuck in its filled
     state after a tap and flip back unpredictably. Press state covers touch. */
  @media(hover:hover){
    #jw-page nav.jw-nav a.jw-track:hover{background:var(--ember);color:#fff}
  }
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav a.jw-track:active{background:var(--ember);color:#fff}
  #jw-page nav.jw-nav a.jw-track svg{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none}
  @media(max-width:760px){#jw-page nav.jw-nav{gap:14px;font-size:13px}
    #jw-page nav.jw-nav a.jw-track{padding:5px 11px}}
  /* Below 520px every link moves into the hamburger panel; only the track
     button stays in the bar. The rules live in the single 520px block below,
     after .jw-menu-btn's base display:none, so the button isn't re-hidden. */

  #jw-page .jw-menu-btn{display:none;margin-left:12px;width:34px;height:34px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
  #jw-page .jw-menu-btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #jw-page .jw-burger,#jw-page .jw-burger::before,#jw-page .jw-burger::after{display:block;width:16px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .18s ease,opacity .18s ease}
  #jw-page .jw-burger{position:relative}
  #jw-page .jw-burger::before,#jw-page .jw-burger::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0}
  #jw-page .jw-burger::before{top:-5px}
  #jw-page .jw-burger::after{top:5px}
  #jw-page .jw-menu-btn[aria-expanded="true"] .jw-burger{background:transparent}
  #jw-page .jw-menu-btn[aria-expanded="true"] .jw-burger::before{top:0;transform:rotate(45deg)}
  #jw-page .jw-menu-btn[aria-expanded="true"] .jw-burger::after{top:0;transform:rotate(-45deg)}

  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav{display:none;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav[hidden]{display:none}
  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:4px 18px 10px}
  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav a{padding:12px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav a:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  @media(max-width:520px){
    /* every nav link, FAQ included, moves into the hamburger panel */
    #jw-page nav.jw-nav a:not(.jw-track){display:none}
    #jw-page nav.jw-nav a.jw-track{padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px}
    #jw-page nav.jw-nav{gap:11px;font-size:12px}
    #jw-page .logo img{height:19px}
    #jw-page .jw-menu-btn{display:inline-flex}
    #jw-page .jw-mobile-nav:not([hidden]){display:block}
  }

  /* ============ buy box ============ */
  #jw-page .buybox{display:grid;gap:34px;padding-top:0}
  
  @media(max-width:879px){
    #jw-page .buybox>.bb-left,
    #jw-page .buybox>.bb-copy{display:contents}
    #jw-page .buybox .bb-media{order:1}
    #jw-page .buybox .bb-head{order:2}
    #jw-page .buybox .bb-buy{order:3}
    #jw-page .buybox .bb-extra{order:4}
    /* without this the promoted icon row defaults to order:0 and jumps
       above the gallery */
    #jw-page .buybox .icon-row{order:5;margin-top:4px}
    /* row-gap only bites in the stacked layout; desktop is a single row and
       keeps the 34px column gutter. The block after the buy panel gets its
       spacing back separately. */
    #jw-page .buybox{row-gap:10px}
    #jw-page .buybox .bb-extra{margin-top:14px}
    /* the buy panel now follows the subhead directly, so its trailing margin
       is just dead space above the sale chip */
    #jw-page .buybox .bb-head .subhead{margin-bottom:0}
  }
  @media(min-width:880px){
    #jw-page .buybox{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:start}
    /* each column is its own flow, so a tall gallery cannot stretch a row and
       leave dead space under the short copy block opposite it */
    #jw-page .buybox>.bb-left,
    #jw-page .buybox>.bb-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
    #jw-page .buybox>.bb-left{gap:26px}
    #jw-page .buybox>.bb-copy{gap:6px}
  }
  /* No fixed aspect ratio: the frame takes the image's own shape, so nothing
     is letterboxed or cropped. Supplier images vary (1000x1000, 1000x940...). */
  #jw-page .gallery-main{width:100%;position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);line-height:0}
  /* outgoing media is lifted out of flow and faded over the incoming one,
     so the new photo is already fully opaque underneath: no white flash */
  #jw-page .gallery-main .gm-out{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:2;opacity:1;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .42s ease}
  #jw-page .gallery-main .gm-out.is-fading{opacity:0}
  #jw-page .gallery-main img,#jw-page .gallery-main video{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  #jw-page .gallery-shell{position:relative}
  /* grid items default to min-width:auto and refuse to shrink below their
     content, which lets the thumb strip widen the column instead of scrolling */
  #jw-page .bb-left{min-width:0}
  #jw-page .bb-media{min-width:0}
  #jw-page .g-arrow{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:38px;height:38px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);cursor:pointer;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .12s ease}
  #jw-page .g-arrow:hover{background:#fff}
  #jw-page .g-arrow:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #jw-page .g-arrow::before{content:"";width:9px;height:9px;border-style:solid;border-color:var(--ink);border-width:2px 2px 0 0}
  #jw-page .g-prev{left:10px}
  #jw-page .g-prev::before{transform:rotate(-135deg);margin-left:3px}
  #jw-page .g-next{right:10px}
  #jw-page .g-next::before{transform:rotate(45deg);margin-right:3px}
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .g-arrow{width:32px;height:32px}}

  /* overflow-y must be explicit: with overflow-x:auto it otherwise computes to
     auto, and the 1px hover lift below then creates a vertical scroll axis
     inside the strip that can swallow horizontal swipes on touch. */
  #jw-page .thumbs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;scroll-snap-type:x proximity;scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  #jw-page .thumbs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  #jw-page .thumb{position:relative;flex:0 0 76px;scroll-snap-align:start;aspect-ratio:1/1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#f4efe8;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;padding:0;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .12s ease}
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .thumb{flex-basis:64px}}
  @media(hover:hover){#jw-page .thumb:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}}
  #jw-page .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  #jw-page .thumb .t-play{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(20,19,17,.72);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  #jw-page .thumb .t-play::after{content:"";border-style:solid;border-width:6px 0 6px 10px;border-color:transparent transparent transparent #fff;margin-left:2px}
  #jw-page .thumb[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .thumb:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}

  #jw-page .trustline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #jw-page .hero-trust{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px;padding:0 10px}
  #jw-page .hero-trust .stars{line-height:1}
  #jw-page .hero-trust .stars{font-size:15px}
  #jw-page .hero-trust-text{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .hero-trust-text svg{color:var(--ember);flex-shrink:0}
  #jw-page .stars{color:var(--ember);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:15px}
  #jw-page h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px);font-weight:800;margin:10px 0 8px}
  #jw-page .bb-copy>h1{margin-top:0}
  #jw-page h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .subhead{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:16px}
  #jw-page .subhead em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember);font-weight:700}
  #jw-page .subhead b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
  #jw-page .chipblock{margin:0 0 18px}
  #jw-page .chip-lead{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:8px}
  #jw-page .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
  #jw-page .chips li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border:1px solid #f3cdb2;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 10px 5px 8px;line-height:1.25}
  #jw-page .chips svg{width:13px;height:13px;flex:none}
  #jw-page .chip-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.45}
  #jw-page .bullets{list-style:none;margin:0 0 18px}
  #jw-page .bullets li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:5px 0;font-size:15.5px}
  #jw-page .bullets svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px}

  #jw-page .price-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 6px}
  #jw-page .price-now{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:32px}
  #jw-page .price-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

  /* sale chip + countdown */
  /* A label, not an alarm: pale tint, sentence case, body weight, date in
     bold as the deadline. No fill, no pulse, no clock. */
  #jw-page .sale-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:#FDF1EA;
    color:#3a3631;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:400;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;
    text-transform:none;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;margin:2px 0 12px;
    border:1px solid #f2ddcd;box-shadow:none;line-height:1.4}
  #jw-page .sale-chip b{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .sale-chip .chip-ico{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;color:var(--ember);opacity:.85}
  /* one flex item, so the text can never split into wrapping columns */
  #jw-page .sale-chip-text{white-space:nowrap}
  @media(max-width:520px){
    #jw-page .sale-chip{font-size:13.5px;padding:6px 12px;gap:6px}
  }
  #jw-page .code-note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:6px 0 14px;
    background:var(--ember-tint);border:1px solid rgba(200,80,15,.28);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px}
  #jw-page .code-note b{color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .code-note b{color:var(--ember)}

  /* quantity tiles */
  #jw-page .stockbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border:1px solid #f3cdb2;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 13px;margin:0 0 12px}
  #jw-page .stockbar[hidden]{display:none}
  #jw-page .stockbar .pulse{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember);flex:none;position:relative}
  #jw-page .stockbar .pulse::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember);animation:jw-ping 1.6s cubic-bezier(0,0,.2,1) infinite}
  @keyframes jw-ping{0%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.7}80%,100%{transform:scale(2.6);opacity:0}}
  #jw-page .tiles{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
  #jw-page .tile{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:start;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:15px 14px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:inherit;width:100%;transition:transform .12s ease,box-shadow .12s ease,border-color .12s ease}
  #jw-page .tile:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .tile[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(200,80,15,.14)}
  #jw-page .tile:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #jw-page .tile .radio{width:18px;height:18px;border:2px solid #b9b0a4;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
  #jw-page .tile[aria-pressed="true"] .radio{border-color:var(--ember);background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--ember) 0 45%,transparent 50%)}
  #jw-page .tile .t-label{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;display:block}
  #jw-page .tile .t-body{display:block;min-width:0}
  #jw-page .tile .t-sub{display:block;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.45}
  /* green reads as money saved rather than another brand accent competing
     with the ember used for price and selection state */
  #jw-page .tile .t-save{color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:700}
  #jw-page .trust3{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin:12px 0 0;padding:0}
  #jw-page .trust3 li{background:#f2efe9;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 8px;text-align:center;line-height:1.35}
  #jw-page .trust3 strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .trust3 span{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page .tile .t-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page .tile .t-sub b{color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .tile .t-off{margin-left:7px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);white-space:nowrap}
  #jw-page .tile .t-price{text-align:right}
  #jw-page .tile .t-total{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:18px}
  #jw-page .tile .t-price{display:block;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
  #jw-page .tile .t-compare{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:12.5px;color:#9a9187;text-decoration:line-through}
  #jw-page .ribbon{position:absolute;top:-11px;right:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ember-hi),var(--ember));color:#fff;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(200,80,15,.3)}
  #jw-page .ribbon.alt{background:var(--ink)}

  #jw-page .addon{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:start;border:1px dashed #d8cec1;border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:14px;margin-bottom:14px;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}
  #jw-page .addon:hover{border-color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .addon input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:0;height:0}
  #jw-page .addon-box{width:20px;height:20px;border:2px solid #b9b0a4;border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;flex:none;margin-top:1px}
  #jw-page .addon-box svg{width:13px;height:13px;opacity:0}
  #jw-page .addon input:checked ~ .addon-box{background:var(--ember);border-color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .addon input:checked ~ .addon-box svg{opacity:1}
  #jw-page .addon input:focus-visible ~ .addon-box{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #jw-page .addon:has(input:checked){border-style:solid;border-color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint)}
  #jw-page .addon-copy b{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:3px}
  #jw-page .addon-copy span{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.45}
  #jw-page .addon-copy a{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);margin-top:4px;display:inline-block}
  #jw-page .addon-price{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page .addon:has(input:checked) .addon-price{color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .cta{display:block;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ember-hi),var(--ember));color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-btn);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:17px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(200,80,15,.28);transition:filter .12s ease,transform .12s ease}
  #jw-page .cta:hover{filter:brightness(.94);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  #jw-page .cta:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:2px}
  #jw-page .cta small{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;opacity:.85;margin-top:2px}
  #jw-page .guarantee-line{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  /* One centred line. Eleven icons only fit if they are small, so they scale
     down rather than wrapping: a near-full row above a stray orphan reads as
     misaligned even when both rows are centred. */
  #jw-page .payrow{display:flex;gap:5px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin:14px auto 0;
    flex-wrap:nowrap;list-style:none;padding:0;max-width:100%}
  #jw-page .payrow li{display:flex;min-width:0}
  #jw-page .payrow .payicon,#jw-page .payrow svg{height:18px;width:auto;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line)}
  @media(max-width:520px){
    #jw-page .payrow{gap:4px}
    #jw-page .payrow .payicon,#jw-page .payrow svg{height:15px}
  }
  #jw-page .certrow{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:12px}
  #jw-page .certrow li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;background:#fff}
  #jw-page .certrow svg{color:var(--ember);flex:none}
  #jw-page .certrow a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  #jw-page .certrow a:hover{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline}

  /* ============ benefit icon row ============ */
  #jw-page .icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0}
  @media(min-width:760px){#jw-page .icon-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
  #jw-page .icon-item{text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page .icon-item svg{margin:0 auto 8px}
  #jw-page .icon-item strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:2px}

  /* ============ empathy / story sections ============ */
  #jw-page .band{background:var(--paper-warm)}
  #jw-page .split{display:grid;gap:30px;align-items:center;margin-top:34px}
  @media(min-width:820px){#jw-page .split{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}#jw-page .split.rev>.split-media{order:2}}
  #jw-page .split h3{font-size:clamp(21px,3vw,27px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px}
  #jw-page .split p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:12px;font-size:16px}
  #jw-page .split p strong{color:var(--ink)}
  /* media never fills the viewport: contained, capped, letterboxed on white */
  #jw-page .split-media{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .split-media{line-height:0}
  #jw-page .split-media figcaption,#jw-page .fig figcaption{line-height:1.45}
  #jw-page .split-media img,#jw-page .split-media video{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}

  #jw-page .loopbox{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:24px 22px 20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .loop{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative}
  #jw-page .loop::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:17px;top:16px;bottom:16px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(#f0d3bd,#e6dbcf)}
  #jw-page .loop li{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:start;padding:9px 0}
  #jw-page .loop .n{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #fff}
  #jw-page .loop b{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;margin-top:6px}
  #jw-page .loop span:not(.n){display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2px}
  #jw-page .loop-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--ember-tint);border-radius:10px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .loop-foot span{font-size:17px}
  #jw-page .usebox{margin-top:30px}
  #jw-page .use-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#jw-page .usebox .loop{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:26px}#jw-page .usebox .loop::before{display:none}}
  #jw-page .loop-note{font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8177;text-align:center;margin-top:12px}
  #jw-page .fig{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .fig>svg{width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}
  #jw-page .fig figcaption{font-size:13.5px;color:#6b645c;text-align:center;margin-top:10px}

  /* ---- Judge.me, restyled to match the page ------------------------------
     Ships teal stars, left alignment and a border-left on its actions wrapper
     that reads as an orphan vertical rule in a centred section. */
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;
    font-family:var(--font-body);color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-star{color:var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-row-stars{justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-widget-actions-wrapper,
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-histogram{border-left:0}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-rev-widg__title{font-family:var(--font-display)}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-rev__title{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-rev__author{font-weight:700}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-rev{border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}
  #jw-page .jdgm-widget .jdgm-write-rev-link{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ember-hi),var(--ember));
    color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius-btn);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;
    font-size:16px;padding:14px 26px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:14px}
  #jw-page .fig.fig-media{padding:0;overflow:hidden}
  #jw-page .fig.fig-media img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:#fff}
  #jw-page .fig.fig-media figcaption{padding:10px 14px 14px}
  #jw-page .media-duo{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#jw-page .media-duo{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}

  #jw-page blockquote.pull{border-left:3px solid var(--ember);padding:6px 0 6px 18px;margin:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-style:italic}
  #jw-page blockquote.pull footer{font-style:normal;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}

  /* ============ comparison table ============ */
  #jw-page .swipe-hint{display:none;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);margin:18px 0 -14px}
  @media(max-width:880px){#jw-page .swipe-hint{display:block}}
  #jw-page .compare-outer{position:relative;margin-top:34px}
  #jw-page .compare-outer .edge-fade{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:56px;background:linear-gradient(to left,#fff 15%,rgba(255,255,255,0));pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s ease;border-radius:0 var(--radius-card) var(--radius-card) 0}
  #jw-page .compare-outer.at-end .edge-fade{opacity:0}
  #jw-page .compare-scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  #jw-page table.compare{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;min-width:640px;font-size:14px}
  #jw-page .compare th,#jw-page .compare td{padding:12px 14px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #jw-page .compare th:first-child,#jw-page .compare td:first-child{text-align:left;font-weight:600;min-width:150px;position:sticky;left:0;background:var(--paper);z-index:2;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  #jw-page .compare thead th{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px}
  #jw-page .compare .you{background:var(--ember-tint);border-left:2px solid var(--ember);border-right:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .compare thead .you{border-top:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:10px 10px 0 0}
  #jw-page .compare tbody tr:last-child .you{border-bottom:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #jw-page .yes{color:var(--ember);font-weight:800}
  #jw-page .no{color:#b9b0a4;font-weight:700}

  /* ============ reviews ============ */
  #jw-page .reviews{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:34px}
  @media(min-width:820px){#jw-page .reviews{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  #jw-page .review{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .review .stars{font-size:13px}
  #jw-page .review p{font-size:14.5px;margin:10px 0}
  #jw-page .review footer{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700}
  #jw-page .review footer span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
  #jw-page .review .answers{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px}

  /* ============ specs / fit ============ */
  #jw-page .spec-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px 40px;margin-top:34px}
  @media(max-width:820px){#jw-page .spec-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:26px 30px}}
  @media(max-width:520px){#jw-page .spec-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}}
  /* plain text, no box: identical cards on every block reads as a component library */
  #jw-page .spec{border:0;background:none;box-shadow:none;padding:0;border-radius:0}
  @media(min-width:760px){#jw-page .spec-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
  #jw-page .spec strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:5px}
  #jw-page .spec span{color:var(--ink-soft)}

  #jw-page .details{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#jw-page .details{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
  #jw-page .details figure{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .details img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  #jw-page .details figcaption{padding:14px 16px 16px}
  #jw-page .details figcaption b{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px}
  #jw-page .details figcaption span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}
  #jw-page .founder{border:1px dashed #c9bfb2;border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:#fff;padding:26px;margin-top:34px}
  #jw-page .founder .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8a8177;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  #jw-page .founder p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:10px}

  #jw-page .gbox{max-width:680px;margin:34px auto 0;border:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:30px;text-align:center;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #jw-page .gbox h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
  #jw-page .gbox p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15.5px;margin-bottom:8px}
  #jw-page .gbox .seal{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 14px;border:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);font-size:13px;line-height:1.1;text-align:center}

  /* ============ FAQ ============ */
  #jw-page .faq{max-width:720px;margin:34px auto 0}
  /* a list with a rule between items, not six identical cards */
  #jw-page .faq-item{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;margin:0;background:none}
  #jw-page .faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #jw-page .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:none;border:none;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;text-align:left;padding:18px 0;cursor:pointer}
  #jw-page .faq-q:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:-3px}
  #jw-page .faq-q .pm{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);font-size:20px;flex:none}
  #jw-page .faq-a{padding:0 0 18px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);display:none}
  #jw-page .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}

  /* ============ final offer / footer ============ */
  #jw-page .final{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
  #jw-page .final h2{color:#fff}
  #jw-page .final .lede{color:#c9c2b9}
  #jw-page .final .cta{max-width:420px;margin:26px auto 0}
  #jw-page .final .guarantee-line{color:#c9c2b9}

  /* ============ sticky bottom bar ============ */
  #jw-page .stickybar{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 -4px 18px rgba(20,19,17,.08);transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .25s ease;padding:10px 14px}
  #jw-page .stickybar.show{transform:translateY(0)}
  #jw-page .stickybar-in{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  #jw-page .stickybar .mini{width:44px;height:44px;flex:none;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover}
  #jw-page .stickybar .info{flex:1;min-width:0}
  #jw-page .stickybar .info b{display:block;font-size:13.5px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  #jw-page .stickybar .info span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #jw-page .stickybar .cta{width:auto;padding:13px 22px;font-size:15px}
  @media(max-width:480px){#jw-page .stickybar .info span em{display:none}}
</style>

<div id="jw-page">

<!-- 1 ▸ ANNOUNCEMENT STRIP -->
<div class="announce">
  {%- if sale_on -%}
    <span class="sale-only">Launch price of <b>{{ unit_disp }}</b> until {{ sale_end | date: '%-d %B' }}. Free UK delivery on every order.</span>
    <span data-sale-off hidden>Free UK delivery on every order. 30-day returns, we pay the postage.</span>
  {%- else -%}
    Free UK delivery on every order. 30-day returns, we pay the postage.
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<!-- 2 ▸ STICKY HEADER -->
<header class="jw-head">
